BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 375.874 Td (5. Staystitch the neckline just inside the seam line so it doesn't stretch while you work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 353.197 Td (6. Sew all darts first, pressing toward the center.) Tj ET
